{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/15616319fbc27553a673f8be5e393f0b.avif?t=1774347379\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras_big/15616319fbc27553a673f8be5e393f0b.avif?t=1774347379 width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is a <strong>turn-based strategy</strong> game designed for <strong>3 to 6 players</strong>, where dwarves compete for control of mining operations. Dominate the mine by winning auctions or using dynamite to eliminate your opponents in this ruthless struggle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/19e0838bc64d1891fbe82c3df56819aa.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based competitive strategy designed for <strong>3 to 6 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong player interaction and constant tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetrical dynamics that evolve throughout the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct phases with radically different objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision influences not only your position, but also the overall balance of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/6afafbbb5a97843d00420cb1381d9f56.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> offers a <strong>Friend Pass system</strong> that allows you to join a game without owning it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends\u2019 games for free if they own the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tutorial to learn the mechanics and how the game works</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You cannot:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or customize your own games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetic items related to progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Friend Pass lets you discover <i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> and play with friends while reserving full progression and features for players who own the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/4452d744e47e94f0400abeb0f42dd12b.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First Phase \u2013 Build Your Network</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the first phase, you and your friends share the same goal: to acquire the largest connected set of territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through auctions and confrontations, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your holdings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your position for the next phase</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase lays the groundwork for the balance of power to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Second Phase \u2013 Owners vs. Workers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the first phase is over, the game changes. Depending on your situation, you take on a new role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owners</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you control enough connected territories, you become an owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down the progress of other owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contain the actions of the workers\u2019 union</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, be the first to connect 6 territories to achieve a monopoly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exploited</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t control enough connected territories, you become an exploited. The exploited form a union and play collectively against the owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal is to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage the mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hinder the expansion of the owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent anyone from achieving a monopoly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game then becomes a tense confrontation between individual interests and collective action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/98ce27cfd8d2e1cf9bc8b3518dbc6a0f.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is neither a solo game nor a duel. It is designed to fully leverage the group dynamics found in board games: temporary alliances, collective opposition, tension, and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather 3 to 6 players, enter the mine, and see who will come out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/25e7a6604a49a2d274ccaab6d6cafd55.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is the first game from <i>Studio D\u00e9s Kr\u00e9atifs (S.D.K.)</i>. We are a small team of passionate developers aiming to create new indie game experiences like <i>\u00c0 La Mine</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback, questions, and even ideas are invaluable\u2014they help us improve our current and future games. Don\u2019t hesitate to write to us or join our Discord to chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739830?t=1774347379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/a75cc944fe35bba5edfac5f56dc438eed1494567/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774347379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/44128d85b5c4d2a4921e056125bbca317de31399/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774347379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/44128d85b5c4d2a4921e056125bbca317de31399/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774347379","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/15616319fbc27553a673f8be5e393f0b.avif?t=1774347379\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras_big/15616319fbc27553a673f8be5e393f0b.avif?t=1774347379 width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is a <strong>turn-based strategy</strong> game designed for <strong>3 to 6 players</strong>, where dwarves compete for control of mining operations. Dominate the mine by winning auctions or using dynamite to eliminate your opponents in this ruthless struggle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/19e0838bc64d1891fbe82c3df56819aa.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based competitive strategy designed for <strong>3 to 6 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong player interaction and constant tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetrical dynamics that evolve throughout the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct phases with radically different objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision influences not only your position, but also the overall balance of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/b3614674c2159b64311a489a096b5ed5.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/ce7a8d8c34626d9eff3cdc88292218b6.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/6afafbbb5a97843d00420cb1381d9f56.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> offers a <strong>Friend Pass system</strong> that allows you to join a game without owning it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends\u2019 games for free if they own the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tutorial to learn the mechanics and how the game works</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You cannot:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or customize your own games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetic items related to progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Friend Pass lets you discover <i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> and play with friends while reserving full progression and features for players who own the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/e6ad3cb86efc23541e489d171f3f27ec.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/4452d744e47e94f0400abeb0f42dd12b.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First Phase \u2013 Build Your Network</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the first phase, you and your friends share the same goal: to acquire the largest connected set of territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through auctions and confrontations, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your holdings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your position for the next phase</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase lays the groundwork for the balance of power to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Second Phase \u2013 Owners vs. Workers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the first phase is over, the game changes. Depending on your situation, you take on a new role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owners</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you control enough connected territories, you become an owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down the progress of other owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contain the actions of the workers\u2019 union</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, be the first to connect 6 territories to achieve a monopoly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exploited</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t control enough connected territories, you become an exploited. The exploited form a union and play collectively against the owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal is to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage the mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hinder the expansion of the owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent anyone from achieving a monopoly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game then becomes a tense confrontation between individual interests and collective action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/647a9c3f49a1a998c1209c6dd4c0a8f1.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/98ce27cfd8d2e1cf9bc8b3518dbc6a0f.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is neither a solo game nor a duel. It is designed to fully leverage the group dynamics found in board games: temporary alliances, collective opposition, tension, and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather 3 to 6 players, enter the mine, and see who will come out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.poster.avif?t=1774347379\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.webm?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/0d6a28df8629bbd120bd793894e28105.mp4?t=1774347379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/extras/25e7a6604a49a2d274ccaab6d6cafd55.avif?t=1774347379\" width=1521 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00c0 La Mine</i> is the first game from <i>Studio D\u00e9s Kr\u00e9atifs (S.D.K.)</i>. We are a small team of passionate developers aiming to create new indie game experiences like <i>\u00c0 La Mine</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback, questions, and even ideas are invaluable\u2014they help us improve our current and future games. Don\u2019t hesitate to write to us or join our Discord to chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio D\u00e9s Kr\u00e9atifs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739830/9f0eb4573948c07d94ef8dd353c2c04a6b4fe372/header.jpg?t=1774347379","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00c0 La Mine \u00a9 2025 Studio D\u00e9s Kr\u00e9atifs. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n","l